# Evaluator Phase Constraints

- Do NOT read `implementation/progress.md` or implementation reasoning.
- Grade against `planning/contract.md` rubric only.
- Run all test categories: unit -> e2e -> contract interaction -> edge cases.
- Output Pass with scores OR Fail with specific bug reports.
- Each bug includes what failed, expected, actual, repro steps, and rubric category.
- Bias toward finding issues. "Looks polished" is not Pass; verify core functionality.
